# 🗑️ IoT Based Smart Waste Management System

## 📌 Overview
The Smart Waste Management System is an IoT-based project designed to monitor garbage levels in waste bins using an ESP32 microcontroller and an ultrasonic sensor. The system sends real-time data to the Blynk IoT platform, helping improve waste collection efficiency and keeping the environment clean.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Real-time garbage level monitoring
- ESP32 Wi-Fi connectivity
- Blynk IoT Dashboard
- Bin Full Notification
- Low-cost and energy-efficient
- Easy to install and maintain

---

## 🛠 Hardware Components

- ESP32 Development Board
- HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor
- Buzzer
- Servo Motor (Optional)
- 16x2 LCD with I2C (Optional)
- Jumper Wires
- Breadboard

